Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.10,0:04:11.02,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}Zugzwang Ra-ta-ta-ta
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.02,0:04:14.81,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}この掌で
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.31,0:04:14.65,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}Zugzwang Du-Ra-ta-ta
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.48,0:04:18.32,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}白黒ビジョン　這い上がって前へ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.02,0:02:52.98,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}蝴蝶還未圓夢成鳥
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.98,0:02:56.32,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}它振動起脆弱的羽翼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.48,0:02:59.74,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}伸出舌頭等待時機
