Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.72,0:04:09.22,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}弱小的棋子啊 舞動起來
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.10,0:04:11.02,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}Zugzwang Du-Ra-ta-ta
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.02,0:04:14.81,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}在我的掌心上
